fn.p:
N: number of subjects;
CON: control group; aMCI: amnestic mild cognitive impairment due to
AD; ADD: Alzheimerʼs disease dementia; AD spectrum: aMCI plus
AD; PD: Parkinsonʼs disease; PD-NC: Parkinsonʼs disease
with normal cognition; PD-IC: Parkinsonʼs disease with impaired
cognition including Parkinsonʼs disease dementia and Parkinsonʼs
disease mild cognitive impairment; PD spectrum: PD-NC plus PD-IC;
FTD: frontotemporal dementia; MMSE: mini-mental state examination;
CDR: clinical dementia rating.

MMSE: mini-mental state examination;
CDR: clinical dementia rating; no significant results found in all
independent variables of both PD spectrum and FTD groups.
